 Calvert, Ken [R-CA-41]","party":"R","state":"CA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-27","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Veterans Scam And Fraud Evasion Act of 2025 or the VSAFE Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill establishes a Veterans Scam and Fraud Evasion Officer within the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) to be responsible for fraud and scam prevention, reporting, and incident response plans at the VA.</p><p>The bill also extends certain loan fee rates through June 23, 2034, under the VA's home loan program.</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-08T16:04:16Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"VSAFE Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-02-04T05:06:24Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-13T19:46:28Z"}
